{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25962","headline":"秋夜闻郑山人弹楚妃怨 · 鲍溶","name":"秋夜闻郑山人弹楚妃怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明月摇落夜，深堂清净弦。\n中间楚妃奏，十指哀婵娟。\n寥寥夜含风，荡荡意如泉。\n寂寞物无象，依稀语空烟。\n旅人多西望，客鴈难南前。\n由来感神事，岂爲无情传。\n容华能几时，不再来者年。\n此夕河汉上，双星含凄然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}